{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>由台灣女星兼製作人林心如製作的TVBS新劇《有愛我們牀上談》11月25日舉行首播記者會。先前被傳在排練大尺度親密戲時發生「誤觸」風波的男女主角李程彬、程予希，同場宣傳卻未並肩亮相，受訪時也分屬男女演員兩組。</p><p>台灣周刊曾報道，李程彬在排練親密戲時疑似誤觸程予希的「重要部位」，導致現場一度停拍。報道指，林心如出面協調後，劇組仍取消當天的拍攝。消息傳出後，劇組及兩位演員的經紀方均表示，全劇已順利殺青，演員和工作人員都以專業態度完成拍攝。</p><figure><img alt=\"程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202648746844753920371502.jpeg/p4wNgQRBkcgymZM6cGOcNB3ipZIBKlA_n2CCJ59ggic\"/><figcaption>程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）</figcaption></figure><p>更多林心如新劇《有愛我們牀上談》女主角程予希的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202649283262681088854921.jpeg/CSHHJULtCZKJ5usxVHqV8vG3d7l3pys42eO7_Nnju_w\"/><figcaption>程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202649286211407872309571.jpeg/pE9xuOunt89F4Zg0wN-gOcgf9_A_ExpZt3XAP7d1wD8\"/><figcaption>程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202649288954613760196528.jpeg/_VHFjvGUtpdHgisH2uFmj6Ab6n8xqLn9iA_h3ogP4d4\"/><figcaption>程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202649291186114560078916.jpeg/_AV-_alpi_MpxKncg6P6yz2EpN1qaHw-Br2OeQa9jnk\"/><figcaption>程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202649293602164736460713.jpeg/KjjRGcPEZjeLwrjMggqwjzA3rZm8j9gP0RoEhtEaBIY\"/><figcaption>程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202649271103393792843072.jpeg/sYRvpeuHriFIohjuHmxTJ6pCPjZiDlKG533uj-d97o8\"/><figcaption>程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202649273515249664760821.jpeg/unuQoQcjxK3Ewj_1u8EUZpGzmGIwGBzfEoektxKHpLc\"/><figcaption>程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202649275738361856932578.jpeg/v-LAeH7jAbPba4UrmMXZGFfu3qa-vml_Vbu0PFW7tDw\"/><figcaption>程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202649277726593024793640.jpeg/2HJnaI-Ue4BnaSHw-o_t59A6JCZoTBulPEq-hjxKvoY\"/><figcaption>程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202649280050368512756893.jpeg/-20TKiGLYwNnUEq8uTiAy7-Vxsao_IeDVLUIEFS1CBA\"/><figcaption>程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202649261062230016528710.jpeg/lMhiWfx_TM9-FKTkHHIE7KmkbMhfAQrds6eii7Onoos\"/><figcaption>程予希（Instagram＠lyan616）</figcaption></figure><p>林心如在25日的記者會上說，劇組從開拍前到正式拍攝，都安排專業親密指導陪同。她也在現場把關，並強調會尊重女演員的感受。</p><p>李程彬被問及「誤觸」傳聞，神情一度顯得緊張。他說，劇組在拍攝親密戲前做足準備，正式拍攝時也有親密指導在場。</p><p>被問到與程予希事後有沒有當面溝通，他說，相關溝通都透過親密指導進行。對於一度拍不下去的說法，他回應：「也沒有，還是有一直拍完。」他也透露，兩人私下沒有聯絡，平時會聯絡的多是相識多年的朋友。</p><figure><img alt=\"李程彬（Instagram@tobylee1122）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202650002564845568179605.jpeg/-uSD2ChGyD60bP3H6Zz-YcJ77vpOuVuh5VGjxeVRo8U\"/><figcaption>李程彬（Instagram@tobylee1122）</figcaption></figure><p>程予希受訪時說，經紀公司當時已代為回應，並肯定劇組拍攝時的專業與用心。被追問當時是否感到不適，她回應說：「其實大家都蠻有火花的，希望大家多關注這部戲。」</p><p>延伸閲讀：女星紺野Buruma節目遭男諧星當眾「伸手揉捏臀部」　好友痛斥離譜</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閲讀：女星紺野Buruma節目遭男諧星當眾「伸手揉捏臀部」　好友痛斥離譜】Tacos觸摸紺野Buruma的畫面全被攝影機拍下來。（YouTube影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188808218239832064370291.png/xzkqLthDgO74SlevlrZSHQ-fWHUDAofT_SEYPf0hGD0\"/><figcaption>【延伸閲讀：女星紺野Buruma節目遭男諧星當眾「伸手揉捏臀部」　好友痛斥離譜】Tacos觸摸紺野Buruma的畫面全被攝影機拍下來。（YouTube影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810890883895296291874.jpeg/mcukUBtCgwyfMwwiVCUfWWhAVloz9wJM87KiOfOyojk\"/><figcaption>「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810198521745408528641.jpeg/68-L8O3kRebMz4OV4DVWsNV4zCmQtNoRSVUJQklVCUI\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810200933601280801439.jpeg/P7OlVl2MJLYJAJuxvUOhvMbToPbreqxWUilk6lIpZOo\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810203064438784178293.jpeg/ytw9FATd6HTgArZPlL27fnBXsmY6fo3yxh1o6MYdaOg\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810205161721856962385.jpeg/5yErw9-yMfOWntbZkv_hxRN-9xCtTj3Y20gM9ttIDPY\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810207305142272529308.jpeg/oP8mPweGokguX0E_a-2FDsyS3tPi2VJAjumyZ47psmc\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810199801008128136024.jpeg/HbjCcb9iyOgMDc0Q4JkCHk2eeEIJxGriSb2B2Em9gdg\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810201927651328047365.jpeg/Wk_cXGQDFnH7p9_ISyRT516grBNC6jfXv59pmr-faZo\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810203978797056129740.jpeg/K6Gft49GkI8-fXjeNIWSrBF3q9XVZKa42rApxNqwKcQ\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810206088663040652381.jpeg/wbIoSlNlVVwpsYkabqj4wctO2oRMM0AWL2Y4zC9mOMw\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810208198529024382570.jpeg/BGfAmoDU3N0lsUGDbHIJh1G8oN8DAu-e3jShsd40obE\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲《聯合早報》授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:43:59.560549+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1406,"images":25,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T14:30:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T14:37:27.236248+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T14:37:27.236248+00:00","content_hash":"5b913923cb534bf60af910e39812943379575d30c6bcf9a6494ccdd88f07174f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}